<headroom-library version="1" id="bl-cascade-lead" category="Guitar + MIDI" order="40" instrument="guitar" style="Fused High-Gain Arpeggio">
  <description>Step on Engage and the chord under your fingers cascades as a saw-lead arpeggio fused with your re-plucked strings into a cranked British 120-watt head. Single notes on top become the melody the arpeggio climbs to. Let go and it is a lead amp again.</description>
  <tags><tag>Bloom</tag><tag>Arpeggio</tag><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Lead</tag><tag>Synth</tag><tag>Guitar + MIDI</tag><tag>Poly</tag></tags>
